&lt;/span>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>There are a lot of &lt;del>hidden&lt;/del>(not actually) treasures lying scattered across the internet. This list is an attempt to bring to light those awesome courses which make their high-quality materials, i.e. assignments, lectures, notes, readings and examinations, available online for free.&lt;a href="https://github.com/prakhar1989/awesome-courses/blob/master/README.md" target="_blank">[1]&lt;/a>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>So basically, &lt;strong>This is a personal note for high-quality materials found on the internet for my Data Science degree program at Sabaragamuwa University of Sri Lanka(SUSL).&lt;/strong>&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Commands that i used to optimize my Images</title><link>https://supun.codeberg.page/notes/images/imageoptimize/</link><pubDate>Thu, 26 Sep 2024 14:56:31 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://supun.codeberg.page/notes/images/imageoptimize/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group">AV1F
&lt;div id="av1f" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#av1f" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>First Install &lt;code>avifenc&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;blockquote>
&lt;p>i don&amp;rsquo;t know about other distros but on Void
&lt;code>xbps-install libavif&lt;/code>&lt;/p>
&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>avifenc -j &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">2&lt;/span> -d &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">10&lt;/span> -y &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">422&lt;/span> --min &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">24&lt;/span> --max &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">24&lt;/span> --minalpha &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">24&lt;/span> --maxalpha &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">24&lt;/span> input.img output.avif
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>
&lt;h3 class="relative group">&lt;em>&lt;u>Note&lt;/u>&lt;/em>
&lt;div id="unoteu" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#unoteu" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h3>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>increase number of theards to speed up the process &lt;code>-j 4&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;h1 class="relative group">WEBP
&lt;div id="webp" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#webp" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h1>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>install &lt;code>imagemagick&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;ul>
&lt;li>For &lt;em>lossless&lt;/em>&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>magick mogrify -format webp -quality &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">50&lt;/span> -define webp:lossless&lt;span style="color:#f92672">=&lt;/span>true input.png output.webp
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>&lt;em>lossy&lt;/em> compression&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;">&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh">&lt;span style="display:flex;">&lt;span>magick mogrify -format webp -quality &lt;span style="color:#ae81ff">82&lt;/span> input.png output.webp
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>
&lt;h1 class="relative group">JPEG
&lt;div id="jpeg" class="anchor">&lt;/div>
&lt;span
class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100">
&lt;a class="group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700"
style="text-decoration-line: none !important;" href="#jpeg" aria-label="Anchor">#&lt;/a>
&lt;/span>
&lt;/h1>
